  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting migrant integration and social cohesion in Gabon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports efforts to strengthen migrant integration and social cohesion in Gabon. Working with government institutions, civil society, community organizations, and media professionals, the initiative promotes evidence-based policies, greater public awareness of migration, and inclusive dialogue between migrants and host communities. The project also supports the representation of migrant communities and helps foster informed, balanced public discussions on migration, contributing to more cohesive and inclusive societies.</narrative>
  </description>
